      "content": "i tried testing the solenoids but the readings are still being weirdly inconsistent. it's almost like something is interrupting the signal or the pressure is just dropping out for no reason right when it's supposed to shift. i'm stuck. any other ideas on what could be causing such erratic behavior in the hydraulic circuit?",
